[[91mError[39m] Aeneas does not support interior mutability. This code uses shared references to types with interior mutability (e.g., `Cell`, `RefCell`, atomics, `Mutex`): `&'_ interior_mutability_struct::Counter`.
Shared references are translated as immutable values, so the effects of operations like `Cell::set(&self, ...)` or `AtomicU32::fetch_add(&self, ...)` are lost, and the generated model is unsound (see https://github.com/AeneasVerif/aeneas/issues/1525). Use `-allow-interior-mutability` to only get a warning and generate the unsound model anyway.
